## 4. Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- **Permission Matrix Unit Tests**: Run Jest/Vitest tests to ensure each role evaluates permissions strictly according to matrix specification.
- **API Guard Tests**: Verify that unauthorized role requests return HTTP 403 Forbidden.

### Manual Verification
- **Role Switch Testing**: Test UI components (Record Work Modal, Worker Profile Edit, Bulk Sheet) logged in under different mock user roles to confirm input fields and actions enable/disable correctly.

